=00=00=00=00=00=00=00=00=00=00=00=00=00=00xfsprogs: Space management tool

=46rom: Dave Chinner <dchinner@redhat.com>

Add freespace mapping tool modelled on the xfs_db freesp command.
The advantage of this command over xfs_db is that it can be done
online and is coherent with concurrent modifications to the
filesystem.

This requires kernel extensions to the fiemap command to map free
space indexes.

Signed-off-by: Dave Chinner <dchinner@redhat.com>
